ting on you!\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/dwEpY97.jpg\nhttps://i.imgur.com/8uTfa7V.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IOrune/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/80d49e63/uploads/origins/ca6f42ef-01a0-44f2-b90a-a47829529fdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cba4c165d6b40506ecac46627b58989d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/80d49e63/uploads/origins/ca6f42ef-01a0-44f2-b90a-a47829529fdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cba4c165d6b40506ecac46627b58989d, https://si.imgix.net/80d49e63/uploads/origins/ca6f42ef-01a0-44f2-b90a-a47829529fdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2ec0d2aa6bfef274bf10415f70adbb2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/80d49e63/uploads/origins/ca6f42ef-01a0-44f2-b90a-a47829529fdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df972a13387e6c2056dd8390c1bf69a5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n\nI'd love to have a picture of my character Frost Sitting outside on a bridge and marveling at the diamond dust snow and stars at night.\nHe's sitting with his hands on the fence and kicking out his legs alternatingly \nThe camera angle is facing towards his face and angled very slightly up towards the sky to show the stars and  snow\n\nIf possible, could you show an effect of him slightly using his magic on the snow? Frosts magic can create and/or manipulate  ice and when he does this his horns eyes and claws glow the colors of the aurora, as well as the ice he manipulates.\n\nIf Used slightly the glowing effect would be faint on both Frost and the snow, but the glowing snow could look pretty, like an aurora but near the ground and all around him\n\nThe closest reference I could find to the pose I described: https://images.app.goo.gl/9mhT1AvC4XsZswcz8\n\nFeel free to go as wild or non wild as wanted with the aurora glowing colors,  Frosts clothes are completely optional, add if wanted\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/5939989.frost/7828532.ref", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IOrune/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/97ef0942/uploads/origins/a3bf9476-4159-4460-a7e0-793fd23ac6b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=751a622ee865600f5b46cb176893dfcc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/97ef0942/uploads/origins/a3bf9476-4159-4460-a7e0-793fd23ac6b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=751a622ee865600f5b46cb176893dfcc, https://si.imgix.net/97ef0942/uploads/origins/a3bf9476-4159-4460-a7e0-793fd23ac6b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3993b77e999859c088b9757a4eaff0d6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/97ef0942/uploads/origins/a3bf9476-4159-4460-a7e0-793fd23ac6b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b6ed6071c4e14e28aed72c1ece63eec 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you very much for your help. I would like you to draw a cool frog character wearing ninja-style clothes. I would like you to equip your hand with a shuriken or agarwood. I would be very happy if you could draw it as you like when you have enough time.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IOrune/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e9ad3bcb/uploads/origins/a9abc6b6-88e6-4ff0-b973-9efe3dba846b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bac852c60a78e041ab8554cd7b871b26", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e9ad3bcb/uploads/origins/a9abc6b6-88e6-4ff0-b973-9efe3dba846b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bac852c60a78e041ab8554cd7b871b26, https://si.imgix.net/e9ad3bcb/uploads/origins/a9abc6b6-88e6-4ff0-b973-9efe3dba846b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=217f990831236aa46a981a3852f10bbf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e9ad3bcb/uploads/origins/a9abc6b6-