 a bit shy and hides behind his large hat sometimes, but he likes making new friends. \nAny pose or expression is fine.\nI may use your work as a profile picture or twitch banner\nThank you!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/tyler_hoglund/status/1353990753496793091", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IOrune/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1223ee6e/requests/184973_2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d221fc9bae71792c2e88eb3ecb390e0f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1223ee6e/requests/184973_2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d221fc9bae71792c2e88eb3ecb390e0f, https://si.imgix.net/1223ee6e/requests/184973_2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a968f64eaf385720713467e578dcccc3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1223ee6e/requests/184973_2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b62a8862efa197c18325d9c3f1204eba 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先日のNinja catの別バージョン。\n串団子や焼き鳥を満面の笑みで食べてる感じでお描きいただきたいです。\n詳細は一任いたします。\nよろしくお願い申し上げます。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IOrune/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/517b22cd/requests/115350_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=743b479f8e3af50d02fb247ae8ee6fe5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/517b22cd/requests/115350_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=743b479f8e3af50d02fb247ae8ee6fe5, https://si.imgix.net/517b22cd/requests/115350_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48b2ad712611b90f10565f8c06dc1786 2x, https://si.imgix.net/517b22cd/requests/115350_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2ad8986a2d4e745d5696bfa8da82d63 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello.\n\nI would like to ask for an illustration of Pokémon Go.\n\nTeam Valor's leader, Candela, and\nGallop is with us, and Candela is in a Pokémon battle.\nHe told his defeated teammates to stay calm and win the next one.\nPlease give us an illustration of your encouragement.\n\nFor more information about Candela, please visit\nhttps://www.pokemongo.jp/howto/battle_02/#anc1\n\nI'll leave the details to you.\n\nPlease consider the above.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IOrune/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f9a3517d/requests/114933_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2b4e092752a5b86fc73134130bf0d59", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f9a3517d/requests/114933_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2b4e092752a5b86fc73134130bf0d59, https://si.imgix.net/f9a3517d/requests/114933_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=45ff8bd41f74534b459b0395c95bd770 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f9a3517d/requests/114933_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9a9a4b0614b577509cdc6a8c07819b2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "タイトル:風来人のネコのキャラクター\n主仕様:以前FOWさんのコンペで入賞された作品のセンターに位置するネコちゃんが、風来人の格好で陣笠をくいっと上げてキメ顔している感じでお願いしたいと思います。\nコンペ先や学校の著作権などが絡むかもしれませんので、そのままのネコちゃんは描けないかもしれませんが、pruneさんの絵柄ならどのような感じでも構いません。\n詳細詳細:一任します。\n以上、よろしくお願い申し上げます。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IOrune/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eaa5e44e/requests/114911_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04a7af360c3ab1432c4e1edb573fa2c6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eaa5e44e/requests/114911_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04a7af360c3ab1432c4e1edb573fa2c6, https://si.imgix.net/eaa5e44e/requests/114911_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd22387c6ed22d5adce0cf4692dfe2dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eaa5e44e/requests/114911_0?bg=%23